KXrzqAl14ecQ7kNvwEvs9aj&_nc_oc=Adq4_z_8kh2Ku2ST0G_ehVkxB3gc9b3-UJJazpPnjX41kmcC7WTv3-u303eoNzH6d4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyhCi6foFp8MEg_Xh8zENJBSOrNeZFi-1Oj1L_igZ9NZQ&oe=69C53F37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BRIbFTns-xIQ7kNvwFAT25y&_nc_oc=AdoUKEMklVK1_W9iG9e39FW8YTDNWBF39-zwtKpqlEOy6iRs9cA13mpVWgjz170__tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw2BYdp74WyUZg4RFodwzei2PnU8sz2y8TkEKVhQyTdAw&oe=69C540CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ero7a-nJKCYQ7kNvwEyXaYD&_nc_oc=Adr3GqZM8qajf8pkn9AiYqcpeeh_q8B4lQifZAVj30qTEMgzw8tc2ABUD6ICdwCbAjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx0Rx4pxudjicbkbKHWKAzX5M1MEsyjccmDX_mLq_Tr1g&oe=69C52DEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QIwbOKbQEeEQ7kNvwF0Jw6a&_nc_oc=Adodu5iM9eeLhOR6_G_E6RUMgt-J3h9D45Q1bNr-mCNnjsIvvNS6RvAXhRDyKHKryC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzUiQdIqg_GCdks0E3tcZcsdO9WJSJyVDxHwC0vVs1MwQ&oe=69C51743"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H6a4x6C0WP8Q7kNvwH-HfJF&_nc_oc=Ado3_VL0Uim-Bl9v7CG9ilU_GDrDnK0bIeRjnme0dnKx3u3roKWFYeexUWX9QUYmzd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxlMPGM6sDdG-qxY0sVMcbCWfA5RZVOqAyiVZ4L35AYOw&oe=69C50F98"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sWvNc0fXUMwQ7kNvwGuoM1X&_nc_oc=AdoWjcJF5z9ZJjxJ_nkgRR9coJGIb2BFH8-6O4CagiAmek9sUGNqCVL5EynkYsUEL0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw8vj-y0qU66ifjAEI1_3Dw17m1kgL2AetZme-zFHMedw&oe=69C522BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080